You enter a battle frenzy for [2, 4, 5, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns. During that time, you can not use items, healing has no effect, and your health cannot drop below 1.

At the end of the frenzy, you regain [3%, 8%, 12%, 14%, 17% (TL1-5)] of your health per foe slain during the frenzy.

While Unstoppable is active, Berserker Rage critical bonus is disabled as you lose the thrill of the risk of death.
